WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.706
- [Narrator] It's happened to you.

00:00:01.706 --> 00:00:03.102
You're shopping for shoes.

00:00:03.102 --> 00:00:04.060
You see some.

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:04.893
Click on them.

00:00:04.893 --> 00:00:06.204
But decide, not now.

00:00:06.204 --> 00:00:07.308
Not before payday.

00:00:07.308 --> 00:00:09.230
Not when you're trying
to be better with money.

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:11.064
Not today, Satan!

00:00:11.064 --> 00:00:14.217
So, you click over to
Facebook, trying to run away

00:00:14.217 --> 00:00:16.871
from said shoes, and there they are!

00:00:16.871 --> 00:00:18.123
Haunting you.

00:00:18.123 --> 00:00:19.428
How

00:00:19.428 --> 00:00:22.011
does Facebook know you so well?

00:00:23.192 --> 00:00:24.582
It's not in your head.

00:00:24.582 --> 00:00:26.281
Facebook ads target you,

00:00:26.281 --> 00:00:27.667
and this info isn't hidden.

00:00:27.667 --> 00:00:30.090
If you visit the "How ads
work on Facebook" page

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:31.801
in Facebook's help
center, you see there are

00:00:31.801 --> 00:00:34.371
four categories where
Facebook gets info on you

00:00:34.371 --> 00:00:35.485
for advertising.

00:00:35.485 --> 00:00:37.588
Number one, information
you share on Facebook.

00:00:37.588 --> 00:00:39.933
Things you comment on,
pages and posts you Like,

00:00:39.933 --> 00:00:42.133
and any ads you click on on Facebook.

00:00:42.133 --> 00:00:43.365
Yup, that makes sense.

00:00:43.365 --> 00:00:45.823
Number two, other
information about you from

00:00:45.823 --> 00:00:47.027
your Facebook account.

00:00:47.027 --> 00:00:49.233
You know, this includes
stuff in the About section.

00:00:49.233 --> 00:00:51.109
Okay, that makes sense.

00:00:51.109 --> 00:00:53.869
Number three, information
advertisers and our marketing

00:00:53.869 --> 00:00:55.120
partners share with us.

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:56.184
What?

00:00:56.184 --> 00:00:57.293
What does that mean?

00:00:57.293 --> 00:00:58.331
Well.

00:00:58.331 --> 00:01:00.816
Facebook advertisers
share their info about you

00:01:00.816 --> 00:01:03.414
with Facebook, and in turn Facebook helps

00:01:03.414 --> 00:01:04.947
them improve their ad audience.

00:01:04.947 --> 00:01:07.498
Visit the "Your ad
preferences" page to see

00:01:07.498 --> 00:01:09.808
who Facebook thinks you
are and what they're

00:01:09.808 --> 00:01:11.104
sharing with marketers.

00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:13.702
Wait, one of my interests is blanket?

00:01:13.702 --> 00:01:15.693
And then lastly, the fourth category is

00:01:15.693 --> 00:01:19.147
your activity on websites
and apps off of Facebook.

00:01:19.147 --> 00:01:21.300
Simple enough, just
gathering info on mostly

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:22.506
everything you click on.

00:01:22.506 --> 00:01:24.002
NBD. Moving on.

00:01:24.002 --> 00:01:26.559
But seriously, pages that
have Like or Share buttons

00:01:26.559 --> 00:01:28.732
notify Facebook when users load the page.

00:01:28.732 --> 00:01:31.766
And a code called Facebook
Pixel can be used by

00:01:31.766 --> 00:01:34.863
web publishers and Facebook
alike to track site visitors

00:01:34.863 --> 00:01:38.532
that are also Facebook users
like Stick-Lady Sally here.

00:01:38.532 --> 00:01:40.941
This feature allows both
Facebook and advertisers to

00:01:40.941 --> 00:01:44.020
track data like when Sally
views an advertisers product

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:47.575
and when she adds an
advertisers product to her cart.

00:01:47.575 --> 00:01:50.476
Also, Facebook like many
companies, receives information

00:01:50.476 --> 00:01:52.283
from data collection
firms that can be used

00:01:52.283 --> 00:01:53.850
to target ads to users.

00:01:53.850 --> 00:01:57.410
So, they may know you have those
odd magazine subscriptions.

00:01:57.410 --> 00:01:58.776
Girls and Corpses.

00:01:58.776 --> 00:01:59.609
Ew.

00:01:59.609 --> 00:02:01.793
And retailers have the
option to share loyalty card

00:02:01.793 --> 00:02:04.396
information with Facebook
as part of an ad campaign,

00:02:04.396 --> 00:02:06.473
hypothetically allowing
Facebook to know what

00:02:06.473 --> 00:02:09.072
people purchase at stores IRL.

00:02:09.072 --> 00:02:11.193
We can see how much they
know if we try to place

00:02:11.193 --> 00:02:12.470
an ad with Facebook.

00:02:12.470 --> 00:02:15.646
So, lets spread the word
about my new hypothetical

00:02:15.646 --> 00:02:17.418
restaurant, Puddin's.

00:02:17.418 --> 00:02:19.831
All Puddin, all the time.

00:02:19.831 --> 00:02:22.218
I can choose to place
my ad to be seen by just

00:02:22.218 --> 00:02:24.912
LA-living, 35-year-old
moms, that have an interest

00:02:24.912 --> 00:02:27.212
in desserts and make a good deal of money.

00:02:27.212 --> 00:02:29.081
Cause this is expensive pudding.

00:02:29.081 --> 00:02:31.271
Yeah, it can be that specific because they

00:02:31.271 --> 00:02:34.175
could know that much info about you.

00:02:34.175 --> 00:02:35.823
But despite how personal it might feel,

00:02:35.823 --> 00:02:37.762
you're just data for them to track,

00:02:37.762 --> 00:02:39.709
and that tracking can
be good for businesses

00:02:39.709 --> 00:02:42.156
whose marketing dollars
can potentially go further.

00:02:42.156 --> 00:02:45.246
Super cool for my start-up, Puddin's.

00:02:45.246 --> 00:02:48.007
But maybe you really aren't into online

00:02:48.007 --> 00:02:49.954
interest-based advertising.

00:02:49.954 --> 00:02:51.531
All you wanna do is
see if your friends saw

00:02:51.531 --> 00:02:53.010
you did that amazing hike this morning

00:02:53.010 --> 00:02:54.854
where you snapped the perfect pic,

00:02:54.854 --> 00:02:56.469
not get roped into purchases.

00:02:56.469 --> 00:02:59.092
Well, you can choose not
to be shown certain ads,

00:02:59.092 --> 00:03:02.086
or opt out of ads by specific
advertisers completely.

00:03:02.086 --> 00:03:05.268
And Facebook's data providers,
third parties that gather

00:03:05.268 --> 00:03:08.154
info, have opt-out forms
that users can submit.

00:03:08.154 --> 00:03:10.532
But whether you keep
personalized ads or opt-out,

00:03:10.532 --> 00:03:13.706
you can't stop ads because
ads are needed to help

00:03:13.706 --> 00:03:15.381
keep Facebook free.

00:03:15.381 --> 00:03:17.928
Well, time to get back to puddin-makin.

00:03:17.928 --> 00:03:19.918
I got a lot of moms waiting for me.

00:03:19.918 --> 00:03:22.585
(playful music)

